<Legal title="Privacy Policy" updated="2026-06-22">
  <p>
    This policy explains what Vidova collects and why. Our design
    goal is to keep your content on your machine — only the lightweight AI text
    step and billing touch our servers.
  </p>

  <h2>1. What stays on your device</h2>
  <p>
    Your video topics, scripts, downloaded footage, audio, and rendered videos
    are produced and stored locally. We do not upload your finished videos.
  </p>

  <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account</strong>: email and a user id from your sign-in provider.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage metering</strong>: AI text requests (token counts, timestamps) to debit credits.</li>
    <li><strong>Billing</strong>: payment references from SePay needed to credit your account. We do not store full bank details.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. AI text generation</h2>
  <p>
    When you generate a script or keywords, the topic text is sent to our managed
    AI provider (DeepSeek) via our proxy and is not used to train our models. We
    keep token usage records for billing and abuse prevention.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Cookies & analytics</h2>
  <p>
    The website may use privacy-respecting analytics to understand traffic. The
    app uses local storage to remember your session and preferences.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can request export or deletion of your account data. Deleting your
    account removes your profile and credit ledger associations subject to legal
    retention requirements.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Contact</h2>
  <p>Reach us through the app or our support channel for any privacy request.</p>
</Legal>
